<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Metrogas 6-mo net gain $12.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentine Metrogas 6-mo net gain $12.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-months ended Jun 30</p>
<p>Net gain 12.1 million pesos vs n/a</p>
<p>Net worth 601.3 million pesos vs n/a</p>
<p>Note: Metrogas, which is operated by British Gas Plc, is the largest of Argentina's eight gas distribution companies. It had posted a first quarter net loss of $4.98 million. No other financial details were available.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
